  "description": "The Horizontech Talons 3 Starter Kit is a pioneering pod system that offers more than just a sleek appearance. Designed for vapers who appreciate advanced functionality in a simple and portable form factor, the Talons 3 introduces the world’s first temperature control sub-ohm pod (0.2ohm), allowing precise adjustments to enhance flavour longevity and extend pod lifespan. This cutting-edge feature, combined with Horizontech’s Intelligent Coil Material Recognition, automatically optimises settings for different coil materials, switching between Power Mode for Kanthal coils and Temperature Control Mode for stainless steel builds. This means that the 0.2ohm pod absolutely shines with High-VG e-liquids when DTL vaping. When it comes to daily use, the Talons 3 is built with versatility in mind, and includes both button-activation and inhale-activation modes, along with a handy lock/unlock feature to prevent accidental firing. Its 1500mAh battery provides enough juice for up to 6 days of use, while USB-C fast charging ensures you’re quickly back to full capacity when the time comes for a recharge. With its 2ml leak-resistant pods available in a range of resistances, the Talons 3 supports both mouth-to-lung (MTL) and direct-to-lung (DTL) vaping styles and everything in between, making it an excellent choice for both beginners and experienced vapers. A 0.96” OLED display provides essential information at a glance, while a suite of adjustable settings, including stepless airflow control, allows you to tailor your vape experience to your exact preference. With this array of innovative features, the Horizontech Talons 3 Starter Kit is that rare vape device that can be as simple and straightforward as newer vapers need it to be, while offering unprecedented customisation and control for more advanced vapers. Available in a wide range of striking colours, the Horizontech Talons 3 Starter Kit is both a functional powerhouse and a sleek and stylish vaping companion. When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil. 1500mAh Built-in Battery: Long-lasting power that can last up to 6 days on a single charge Temperature control (200°F to 500°F) for extended flavour and pod lifespan with stainless steel coils Automatically optimises settings, switching between Power Mode (Kanthal) and Temperature Control Mode (Stainless Steel) Fully adjustable airflow to tailor your draw to MTL, RDL, or DTL preferences Supports both button-activated and inhale-activated firing Triple-click to lock and prevent accidental firing, with auto-draw still active when locked Convenient, rapid recharging to minimise downtime Clear display showing wattage, temperature, coil recognition, and battery life Compact and Portable Design Compatible with High-VG E-liquids: Ideal for rich flavour and dense vapour production with High-VG e-liquids Discover premium liquid vape options to elevate your experience with this kit. We recommend using High VG (sub-ohm) E-Liquiid with the 0.2ohm pod. Please note: USB-C Cable Sold Separately",
